Platform rules applied: the Pay button and back navigation use Telegram's host MainButton/BackButton (not page-drawn duplicates) when running inside Telegram, with plain-button fallbacks shown only outside Telegram for local dev; colors come from `--tg-theme-*`; layout respects `viewportStableHeight` and safe-area insets; closing confirmation toggles with form dirtiness; haptic feedback marks validation errors and successful payment; all inputs are ≥44px tall for touch targets.
